From 3fe12ab962030802179ac1df78e6bbff3d64b8d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: emergent-agent-e1 <github@emergent.sh>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 05:16:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v1.0.15: Fix build + ad optimisation + Share-to-unlock Pro
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Build fixes:
- Remove @react-native-firebase/app plugin from app.json (was breaking
  expo prebuild because the package is not installed in package.json)
- Restore NativeAdCard.tsx + NativeAdRotator.ts (accidentally deleted
  in earlier v1.0.15 commit 122addb — broke match screen ad slots)

AdMob fixes (reduce request waste, keep income balanced):
- Fix rewarded ad ID mismatch in AdMobContext.native.tsx (was
  6702740458, correct is 6702704058 per app.json) — primary cause of
  UnlockProAd 66 req / 4 impr gap
- App Open Ad: show ONCE per app session, no auto-reload after CLOSED,
  error retries capped at 2 (30s/60s back-off)
- Interstitial Ad: lazy-load — no preload at init, trigger preload 3-5
  clicks before threshold, no auto-reload after CLOSED, error retries
  capped at 2 (30s/60s back-off)
- Rewarded Ad: keep init preload (needed for fast Pro modal)
- Banner2 code untouched
- New context API: prepareInterstitialAd()

Unlock Pro UX: 3 ads → 1 ad (all surfaces)
- ProContext ADS_REQUIRED 3→1
- AdModal progress 3 circles → 1, texts updated
- index.tsx & match/[id].tsx progress + button text updated

New feature — Share to unlock 30 min Pro free:
- Single Share button inside Unlock Pro modal (index.tsx + match/[id].tsx)
- Opens native share sheet (WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram, Facebook,
  Gmail, SMS — whichever app user picks)
- Shares Play Store link
  https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cricapp.live
- Pro is granted ONLY on Share.sharedAction (native success signal) —
  dismissal does NOT unlock Pro, preventing abuse

Version: 1.0.15 (versionCode 15) — unchanged
