           body: |
-            ## CricApp v1.0.10 — AdMob Fix + Strict Ad Enforcement
-            
-            ### Critical Changes
-            - **Removed 10-fail ad fallback logic** — ads MUST be watched to progress, no automatic unlock
-            - **Restored v1.0.7 strict ad behavior** — if ad fails to load, user gets "try again" alert (no skip)
-            - **Changed to 3 rewarded ads** for Pro unlock (from 2)
-            - **Fixed AndroidManifest.xml merger conflict** with Firebase Messaging (build pipeline now stable)
-            
-            ### Ad Behavior (v1.0.7 Compatible)
-            - **App Open Ad**: Triggers on app cold start (after SDK init)
-            - **Interstitial Ad**: Shows after 50-60 random clicks (non-Pro users)
-            - **Rewarded Ad**: User must watch 3 ads to unlock Pro (30 min)
-            - **Banner Ad**: Medium Rectangle, always visible at bottom
-            - **NO SKIP**: If ad fails, user cannot progress — must retry
-            
-            ### Ad Unit IDs (Verified from AdMob Console)
+            ## CricApp v1.0.15 — Ad Optimisation + Share-to-Unlock Pro
+
+            ### Build fixes (resolves previous v1.0.15 failed build)
+            - Removed `@react-native-firebase/app` plugin from `app.json` (was breaking `expo prebuild` — package not installed)
+            - Restored `NativeAdCard.tsx` + `NativeAdRotator.ts` (deleted in earlier v1.0.15 commit, referenced by `match/[id].tsx`)
+
+            ### AdMob request-waste fixes (keeps income, reduces wasted requests)
+            - **CRITICAL FIX**: rewarded ad ID in native context was wrong (`6702740458`) — corrected to match `app.json` (`6702704058`). Main cause of UnlockProAd 66 req / 4 impr in last report.
+            - **App Open Ad**: shows ONCE per app session. No auto-reload after CLOSED. Error retries capped at 2 with 30s/60s back-off (previously infinite 5s retries).
+            - **Interstitial Ad**: LAZY load — no preload at app init. Prepared 3-5 clicks before threshold. No auto-reload after CLOSED. Error retries capped at 2 with 30s/60s back-off.
+            - **Rewarded Ad**: init preload retained for fast Pro modal.
+            - **Banner2**: completely untouched.
+
+            ### Unlock Pro — 3 ads → 1 ad
+            - `ProContext` `ADS_REQUIRED` 3 → 1. All progress UI shows `1 of 1`.
+
+            ### NEW — Share to Unlock Pro (viral growth)
+            - Single "Share" button inside Pro modal (index + match screens).
+            - Opens native Android share intent — user picks WhatsApp, Telegram, Instagram, Facebook, Gmail, SMS, etc.
+            - Shares Play Store link: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cricapp.live
+            - Pro granted ONLY on `Share.sharedAction` (native success). Dismiss → no Pro.
+            - **Daily quota: 1 share-unlock per device per day** — keeps AdMob revenue flowing while still giving viral incentive.
+
+            ### Ad Unit IDs (from AdMob Console)
             - App Open: `ca-app-pub-9675798593675825/4826782503`
             - Interstitial: `ca-app-pub-9675798593675825/8438724452`
             - Banner: `ca-app-pub-9675798593675825/8616886104`
             - Rewarded: `ca-app-pub-9675798593675825/6702704058`
-            
-            ### Build Fixes
-            - Direct sed patch added to GitHub Actions after `expo prebuild` to inject `tools:replace` attributes
-            - Resolves `@color/white` conflict from `react-native-firebase_messaging`
-            
